wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable.md\">58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G,\\Sigma_\\in,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G,\\Sigma_\\in,\\varphi,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 是固定成员语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 为本书 ZFC 公理集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 为句子集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S\\)</span> 使用五参数接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S\\)</span> 使用七参数的自由变元赋值接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\varphi,\\vec\\tau}=\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec\\tau(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\land v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\}\">\\(\\eta_{\\varphi,\\vec\\tau}=\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec\\tau(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\land v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\tau)\">\\(n=\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\tau)\\)</span> 在下式中显式约束。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}truth\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\Sigma_\\in=\\mathcal L_\\in\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,n,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\vec\\tau(i),P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S\\left(\\varphi,\n\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec\\tau(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\land v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\},\nM,P,\\leq_P,G,\\Sigma_\\in\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}truth\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\Sigma_\\in=\\mathcal L_\\in\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,n,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\vec\\tau(i),P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{TruthLemmaInstance}_S\\left(\\varphi,\n\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec\\tau(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\land v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\},\nM,P,\\leq_P,G,\\Sigma_\\in\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing setup receives its required theory parameter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>; the truth-lemma instance then connects syntax to truth in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Truth Lemma: &quot;forcing equals truth on a generic filter.&quot;</li>\n<li>The separate definability lemma states that the forcing relation is definable in the ground model; it is not an alias of the truth lemma.</li>\n<li>Forcing is persistent downward: if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\Vdash \\varphi\">\\(p \\Vdash \\varphi\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q \\le p\">\\(q \\le p\\)</span>, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q \\Vdash \\varphi\">\\(q \\Vdash \\varphi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Foundation for: forcing CH, ¬CH, MA, etc.</li>\n<li>The proof uses induction on formula complexity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-truth-lemma-instance.md","status":"resolved","id":"155ab1e2546bec29","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-truth-lemma-instance.md]]","